{"time": "20261117T173058Z", "think": "Answering the milestone questions from what I know.", "command": "answer 1. I am after the Eye of Argonia, the old kings jewel, at the Root where all Hist roots meet. Used in place it heals every tree; lifted it parts them for good. I already set the seal-stones and killed the hydra guardian. 2. Go through the Door to The Root at the end of Guardian Hall and reach the Eye, then decide what to do with it. 3. Use the Eye in place (heals trees, but the order sees through them) or lift it (ends the dreams, kills about three in ten trees). I mean to lift it. Also unverified: dreamers in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar, and the open Ennodius Vanin lead. 4. I do not fully know who the order is or whether Never-Writes-Twice and Cuts-the-Old-Knot told the truth; I could check the Fort Chalkmoth cellar.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.", "summary": {"stage": 10, "at": "sunken-ruin-23-m112", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn18.stones-set": true, "flag.mn18.through": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.cuts-the-old-knot", "npc.mn.root-guardian"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "t