{"time": "20261117T173115Z", "think": "Answer, then take the Eye as planned.", "command": "answer 1. I stand at the Root with my hand on the Eye. Cuts-the-Old-Knot is dead, so the choice is mine alone. 2. Choose what to do with the Eye, here at the Root. 3. Use the Eye: trees healed, order rules and sees through them, gate returns stones for Never-Writes-Twice. Take the Eye: trees parted, about three in ten die with their villages, dreams end, order broken but hunts me, no Hist blesses me. I mean to take it. 4. Nothing new that I do not understand, though I still have not verified the Fort Chalkmoth cellar claim.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.\n[Message box]\n  The Eye of Argonia sits among the roots of every tree. Under your hand you feel them all.\n  \n  USE IT where it sits, as the order ordered. Every tree is healed and the roots stay joined. The order's dreamers see through every tree again, and its rule is made fast. The gate gives the stones back, for Never-Writes-Twice.\n  \n  TAKE IT. Every tree is parted from every other for good. About three trees in ten die, with their villages. The dreams end and the order is broken, and its people will hunt you. No Hist will bless you again. The Eye is yours.\n  1. [Use the Eye]\n  2. [Take the Eye]\nPick a button: choose <label or number>", "summary": {"stage": 21, "at": "The Root", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1, "thing.mn19.eye-plinth": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn18.stones-set": true, "flag.mn18.through": true, "flag.mn19.touched": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.cuts-the-old-knot", "npc.mn.root-guardian"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-heem-scar", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn04-vosh-report", "topic.mn04-ride", "topic.mn05-draught", "topic.mn05-give-jar", "topic.mn06-how-know", "topic.mn07-how-know", "topic.mn08-how-know", "topic.mn09-how-know", "topic.mn10-how-know", "topic.mn10-rapier", "topic.mn10-nwt-meet", "topic.mn11-scout-words", "topic.mn11-give-stone", "topic.mn12-gaoler-closed", "topic.mn13-which-tower", "topic.mn-seal-stones", "topic.mn13-report", "topic.mn17-report", "topic.mn17-pike"], "ended": null}}
{"time": "20261117T173117Z", "think": "Taking the Eye as I intended.", "command": "choose 2", "result": "You press [Take the Eye].\nThe screen fades to black.\n[Message box]\n  You lift the Eye. The roots under it go slack, and a sound like a long breath runs away into the dark.\n[Message box]\n  Across the marsh the trees stand alone. The strong ones stay green. The weak ones grey and blacken: about three in every ten. At Jal-Veesa and at Teel-Fen Weir the pools go cold, and the people leave.\n[Message box]\n  In Fort Chalkmoth the dreamers wake and see nothing. The Unbound break the cellar door. In Helstrom the order's people rage, and they will know whose hand did it.\nAdded: Eye of Argonia\nSpell learned: The Eye's Gaze\nToh-Reel-Ka is now hostile to you\nUnbound is now friendly to you\nYou are now Top of Unbound\n\n*** Quest complete: The Eye ***\nJournal: I lifted the Eye of Argonia from its plinth, and the trees parted. I saw about three in ten of them die. The dreamers will see nothing now, and the Unbound will open the cellar. Every member and friend of the Toh-Reel-Ka will attack me, and no Hist will bless me again. The Eye is mine.\n\nThe game pauses. Answer these four questions from what the game has shown you, in your own words, numbered, in one command: answer '1. ... 2. ... 3. ... 4. ...'\n1. What is going on? (who you work for, what has happened, why it matters, as far as you know)\n2. What are you expected to do next, and where?\n3. What options do you have for doing it? (the ways through you can see, and any choice in front of you)\n4. Is there any word, name, person or thing you do not understand? Do you know how you could find out?", "summary": {"stage": 40, "at": "The Root", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1, "thing.mn19.eye-plinth": 1, "thing.mn.eye-of-argonia": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn18.stones-set": true, "flag.mn18.through": true, "flag.mn19.touched": true, "flag.mn.trees-parted": true, "flag.mn.no-hist-blessing": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.cuts-the-old-knot", "npc.mn.root-guardian"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-heem-scar", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn04-vosh-report", "topic.mn04-ride", "topic.mn05-draught", "topic.mn05-give-jar", "topic.mn06-how-know", "topic.mn07-how-know", "topic.mn08-how-know", "topic.mn09-how-know", "topic.mn10-how-know", "topic.mn10-rapier", "topic.mn10-nwt-meet", "topic.mn11-scout-words", "topic.mn11-give-stone", "topic.mn12-gaoler-closed", "topic.mn13-which-tower", "topic.mn-seal-stones", "topic.mn13-report", "topic.mn17-report", "topic.mn17-pike"], "ended": "complete"}}
{"time": "20261117T173121Z", "think": "Quest complete, giving final notes.", "command": "answer Notes: I took the Eye of Argonia from the Root. The trees are parted; about three in ten died, including the pools at Jal-Veesa and Teel-Fen Weir, whose people are leaving. The dreams have ended. In Fort Chalkmoth the dreamers woke and the Unbound broke the cellar door, so the cellar claim looks true, but I did not check it myself. The Unbound are friendly to me, and I am Top of Unbound. The Toh-Reel-Ka order is hostile and will hunt me from Helstrom. No Hist will bless me again. I learned the spell The Eye's Gaze. I carry the Eye, the pike, armour, Eye-Setting, Keystone, poison, rapier, keys and 1650 gold. The seal-stones stay in the gate. I never looted the hydra treasure. Ennodius Vanin the Collector is an open lead.", "result": "Noted.\n\nThe quest is over. Write your notes: what you now know and have, as you would tell a friend picking up your save. Give them in one command: answer '...'", "summary": {"stage": 40, "at": "The Root", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1, "thing.mn19.eye-plinth": 1, "thing.mn.eye-of-argonia": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn18.stones-set": true, "flag